nge the  narrative we're against illegal voters  they barely exist though and the real  issue is voter suppression it's not  voter fraud and this has been a at this  point I don't know it is could we say  it's a multi-decade effort to suppress  votes in a way that is strategically  advantageous to Republicans don't let  them play the games a good that this guy  Whitley has resigned bad that he was  able to whitewash the resignation with  this bogus resignation letter and now  we've got to see who it is  that the governor Abbott is going to  nominate probably won't be out until  after the 2020 election
 

